linux-image-amd64-

# The kernel comes from trixie-backports: the kernel RBD client only reads the
# aes256k keys of Ceph 21 from Linux 7.0 on, and a single kernel for every
# image keeps the cukinia package list and the RT tuning in one place.
# The backports kernel depends on "dracut | initramfs-tools": name
# initramfs-tools, which configure_physical_machine configures, or apt takes
# dracut, the first alternative.
PACKAGES install-norec release=trixie-backports
initramfs-tools
linux-image-rt-amd64
